1), In Suspect Terrain (1983), Rising from the Plains (1986), and Assembling California (1993), plus a final book, Crossing the Craton. A narrative table of contents provides an overview of the project, which largely consisted of a series of road journeys by McPhee across the North American continent in the company of noted geologists. In 2023, the composers and artists John P. Hastings and Benjamin Mayock completed a visual and audio translation of the book entitled The Former World.","matchedBy":"infobox_book:high","confidence":"high","attribution":{"label":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Annals_of_the_Former_World","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"},"infobox":{"title":"Annals of the Former World","author":"John McPhee","publisher":"Farrar, Straus and Giroux","publicationDate":"1998","pages":"696","isbn":"978-0-374-10520-4","subject":"Geology"},"publisherEvidenceId":"publisher-evidence-wikipedia-annals-of-the-former-world-john-mcphee"},"sources":[{"id":"source-award-record-pulitzer-general-nonfiction-wikipedia-pulitzer-prize-for-general-nonfiction","label":"Wikipedia: Pulitzer Prize for General Nonfiction","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pulitzer_Prize_for_General_Nonfiction","accessedAt":"2026-08-20T21:35:58.016Z","confidence":"secondary","field":"award","note":"Official category URL: https://www.pulitzer.org/prize-winners-by-category/223"},{"id":"source-publisher-cleanup-curation","label":"Manual publisher/imprint cleanup for generated catalog metadata","url":"","confidence":"manual","note":"Maps catalog-provider publisher strings that are actually imprints or aliases onto curated parent publishers and imprint records."},{"id":"source-google-books-annals-of-the-former-world-john-mcphee","label":"Google Books metadata for Annals of the Former World","url":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=GS81F0RNxesC","accessedAt":"2026-05-11T17:05:31.114Z","confidence":"catalog","field":"book"